OL,3,GNEWSAPremier League fans and players
OL,4,Ahonour Noah Woods
OL,5,
OL,6,FA tribute to three-year-old Noah Woods
OL,7,Fwas shown on the big screen ahead of
OL,8,Fthe Everton vs Ipswich Town Premier
OL,9,FLeague match, while players wore black
OL,10,Farmbands in his memory.
OL,12,FThe toddler became separated from a
OL,13,Frelative after visiting a playground in
OL,14,FMerriam Close, Brantham, on Tuesday
OL,15,Fafternoon, Suffolk Police said.
OL,17,FAbout 1,300 members of the public
OL,18,Fjoined a search to find Noah, who
OL,19,Fpolice said was non-verbal, partially
OL,20,Fdeaf and had been undergoing an
OL,21,Fassessment for autism.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
